# Admin (`@nucleify/admin`)

Separate Nuxt app for admin UI. Source under `admin/src/`.

## Conventions

- Shared code: import from `shared_modules/nuc_*/…`
- Admin-only UI: keep in `admin/src/` — do not put in `web/` or `shared_modules/`
- Overrides: `overrides/admin/`
- Rules: `admin/.config/rules/`
- Agents: `web/.cursor/agents/`

## Structure

```
admin/
├── src/
│   ├── pages/[lang]/
│   ├── plugins/
│   └── …
├── .config/          # Nuxt config, rules
└── package.json
```
